==Trivia==
This card is almost identical to {{TCG ID|Surging Sparks|Feebas|41}} from the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]'s {{TCG|Surging Sparks}} expansion, except for the {{TCG|Weakness}} modifier and {{TCG|Energy}} cost of the Leap Out attack.
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Primal Clash|Feebas|43}} from the {{TCG|Primal Clash}} expansion.
*'''Leap Out''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Deoxys|Magikarp|64}} from the {{TCG|EX Deoxys}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Moon}}.

